{"c":"421043","n":"LUŽNICE 11","t":"M","s":"JČ","o":"České Velenice","url":"421043-luznice-11","stav":"2026-10-06","popis":"Přítok Vltavy. Od jezu Šulcova mlýna v Tušti až ke státní hranici s Rakouskem. V Nové Vsi nad Lužnicí je zákaz rybolovu do vzdálenosti 50 m pod a nad rybím přechodem (označeno cedulemi). Jelec jesen a mník jednovousý jsou celoročně hájeni.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nDo revíru patří nádrže:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nRybná\tv k. ú. České Velenice\t2,8 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 48°46'28.930\"N, 14°55'57.126\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nVelké Hliniště (Cihelna)\tČeské Velenice\t1 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 48°46'9.822\"N, 14°56'56.598\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nNa nádrži Rybná je zákaz lovu ryb z hráze.","delka":17,"rozloha":32,"lat":48.815672,"lon":14.9279,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/ceske-velenice","mo_tel":"","mo_mail":"velenice@mo.jcus.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podh